# {{PROJECT_NAME}} Dashboard

## Status Overview

### Open Issues
```dataview
LIST
FROM "{{PREFIX}}/issues"
WHERE status = "open" OR status = "in-progress"
SORT status ASC
```

### In Progress
```dataview
TABLE status, tags
FROM "{{PREFIX}}"
WHERE status = "in-progress"
SORT file.mtime DESC
```

### Recently Completed
```dataview
TABLE status, updated
FROM "{{PREFIX}}"
WHERE status = "closed" OR status = "completed"
SORT updated DESC
LIMIT 10
```

## Task Breakdown

### By Status
```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  status as "Status",
  length(rows) as "Count"
FROM "{{PREFIX}}/issues"
GROUP BY status
```

### By Type
```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  type as "Type",
  length(rows) as "Count"
FROM "{{PREFIX}}"
WHERE type
GROUP BY type
```

